====================================================================================================
2. THE TOY PROOF AS A WHOLE: THREE GENERATORS
====================================================================================================
  generator 1 -- the block, protocol.rs:486, domain = the profile
      320,908 fp() draws, 5,396,672 stream bytes
  generator 2 -- the input endpoint, private_seam.rs:196
  generator 3 -- the output endpoint, private_seam.rs:196
      3,072 fp() draws each, 114,688 stream bytes each
  TOTAL fp() draws = 320,908 + 2 x 3,072 = 327,052
  decision D9 / the accepted statement carry 327,052.  MATCHES

  Independence between the three: INFORMATION-THEORETIC, not M-3 --
  three separate /dev/urandom reads (rng.rs:45-46), each keying its
  own stream.  (Correction C-11 of the toy joint-law memo.)
  Independence WITHIN generator 1 -- between the salt segments and
  the blinding segments -- is M-3 and nothing else.

